The '''Wardrobe''' is a storage system for [[Armor]], allowing the player to easily design setups and quickly swap between them.

'''Wardrobe''' is also used as a part of [[Loadouts]] system.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Usage ==
Players can store [[Armor]] in the '''Wardrobe'''. Entire [[Armor#Sets|armor sets]] can be added, or a mix of pieces can be entered, depending on which the player prefers. Wearing a full armor set for the first time will save the date in the armor's slot in the '''Wardrobe'''. The player cannot modify their current set. 

The player can find the '''Wardrobe''' in the [[SkyBlock Menu]] after unlocking {{SkyBlock Level|5}} or using the {{Code|/wd}} command to open the '''Wardrobe'''.

More armor slots are unlocked the higher the player's [[Ranks|Rank]].
